From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 29 Dec 2025 14:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add option to preserve accessibility code in WASM builds

The pdf-xlsx module needs accessibility code because PDF import uses
accessible text handling. This patch documents the intent - upstream
25.8 already preserves accessibility for the calc module.

diff --git a/configure.ac b/configure.ac
--- a/configure.ac	2026-01-29 12:37:42.674041208 +0000
+++ b/configure.ac	2026-01-29 12:37:42.674063400 +0000
@@ -4256,6 +4256,7 @@
         for i in $with_wasm_module; do
             case "$i" in
             calc)
+                # PDF import requires accessibility code for text handling
                 ENABLE_WASM_STRIP_ACCESSIBILITY=
                 ENABLE_WASM_STRIP_CALC=
                 ;;
